  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi Donor Trust Fund for Forced Displacement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The overall purpose of the Trust Fund is to identify and address  opportunities for improving the Bank&apos;s contribution to an enhanced  development response to forced displacementcomma that supports  economically and socially sustainable solutions.
 
 In consultation with Bank regional / country management units and  international partnerscomma the trust fund will facilitate and support  researchcomma preparation and implementation of operationscomma promote  learning and partnership development with international and local  actors to better address forced displacement as a development  challenge. The MDTF will encourage concerned development actorscomma  including the bankcomma to be  engaged from the outset of the crisis that  induces displacementcomma  to ensure that the development dimensions of  recovery are addressed and an effective transition from recovery to  development.
 
 The activities under the TF will be consistent with the Bank&apos;s mandate  and articles of agreementcomma and in accordance with the priorities of  developing country and international agency partners.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
